      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "3. Steam over boiling water on high heat for 8-10 mins or until done."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "4. Remove from the steamer and garnish with the slices of lime and a sprig of coriander."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "5. Prepare the tomato by cutting down from the top into quarters, but not breaking the skin at the bottom. Open it like the petals of a flower and put on the side of the plate."
